中文版：NOTICE

This product includes software developed by third parties. The sections below
list the components bundled in the Windows installer (LunarGold-Setup-x.y.z.exe)
and the licenses under which they are distributed. Four machine-readable
inventories (CycloneDX 1.6) ship with the installer: SBOM.json (Java backend and
all transitive dependencies), SBOM.frontend.json (frontend production
dependencies), SBOM.desktop.json (desktop shell production dependencies) and
SBOM.runtime.json (Electron, trimmed JRE, PostgreSQL and pgvector runtimes).
The complete third-party license and copyright texts are in
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt.

Lunar Gold itself is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE). This NOTICE does not change any third-party license.

