================================================================================
3. Backend (Java / Spring) components
================================================================================

The backend jar contains 243 Maven components. SBOM.json lists every component,
version and declared license. Grouped by declared license:

  Apache-2.0 (202 components), including:
    Spring Boot 4.1.2, Spring Framework, Spring Security, Spring Data,
    Spring AI 2.0.2 (including the MCP client), Flyway, Hibernate ORM and
    Validator, Tomcat embed, Jackson, Netty, Reactor, Micrometer / Prometheus
    client, Log4j API, OkHttp, Okio, Apache PDFBox, Apache POI, Apache Tika
    Core, Swagger / springdoc, Byte Buddy, Kotlin standard library,
    embedded-postgres (io.zonky.test)

  MIT (12):
    checker-qual, jsoup, jtokkit, jul-to-slf4j, lettuce-core, lombok,
    mcp, mcp-core, mcp-json-jackson3, redis-authx-core, slf4j-api,
    webjars-locator-lite

  BSD-3-Clause (9):
    angus-activation, antlr4-runtime, curvesapi, istack-commons-runtime,
    jakarta.activation-api, jakarta.xml.bind-api, jaxb-core, jaxb-runtime, txw2

  EPL-2.0 (7):
    aspectjweaver, junit-jupiter, junit-jupiter-api, junit-jupiter-engine,
    junit-jupiter-params, junit-platform-commons, junit-platform-engine

  EPL-2.0 / BSD-3-Clause (1):
    jakarta.persistence-api

  EPL-2.0 / GPL-2.0-with-classpath-exception (2):
    jakarta.annotation-api, jakarta.transaction-api

  EPL-2.0 / GPL-2.0-with-classpath-exception / BSD-3-Clause (2):
    angus-mail, jakarta.mail-api

  EPL-2.0 / LGPL-2.1-only (2):
    logback-classic, logback-core

  BSD-2-Clause (1): postgresql (JDBC driver)
  BSD-4-Clause (1): ST4
  BSD licence (1): antlr-runtime
  CC0-1.0 / BSD-2-Clause (1): HdrHistogram
  0BSD (1): xz
  MIT-0 (1): reactive-streams

Notes:
  - junit-jupiter and junit-platform are resolved as compile-scope through
    spring-boot-starter-test in Spring Boot 4 and are therefore present in the
    packaged jar. They are test tooling and are not used at runtime.
  - embedded-postgres-binaries-windows-amd64 (test scope) is listed in SBOM.json
    but is not included in the installer; the shipped PostgreSQL runtime is
    built by scripts/build-pg-runtime.ps1.

